-- (run both first). Generated from Baja_Master_BOM_2022-2026.xlsx, sheet "Master BOM" (335 lines).
-- Safe to re-run: lines are matched on source_key and an existing line is LEFT ALONE, so a re-run never
-- duplicates a line and never overwrites a correction or review made on the admin BOM Review page.
-- Prices go to the separate bom_line_costs table (only Business members and cto/admin can read it) and are refreshed.
-- Run it in the Supabase SQL editor (the API cannot write these tables).
-- Links that were not valid http(s) addresses were left blank (0).
-- =========================================================

